<title>POLAND: Mostostal-K Q4 net rises to PLN 2.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-K Q4 net rises to PLN 2.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Krakow SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.47 vs    1.15</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   1.85 vs    2.85</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.63 vs    1.02</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Mostostal Krakow SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 40.86 vs   26.52</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  45.17 vs   21.85</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.28 vs    0.03</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.60 vs    0.94</p>
<p>    other taxes		    refund  0.48 vs    0.89</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     3.85 vs    2.29</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.76 vs    0.63</p>
<p>    investment				 0.24 vs    0.35</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit			 3.00 vs    3.01</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   6.86 vs    5.57</p>
<p>    net profit				 4.67 vs    2.07</p>
<p>    net sales				153.86 vs   96.02</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 150.77 vs   89.37</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.41 vs    0.09</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				 2.65 vs    2.44</p>
<p>    other taxes		   refund   0.46 vs    1.05</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     6.99 vs    3.88</p>
<p>    financial costs			  3.55 vs    2.76</p>
<p>    investment				 1.42 vs    1.07</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
